    "sgl_b2b_partner_9DKyGz": {
      "name": "SGL B2B / Partner",
      "settings": {
        "accent_color": "#636464",
        "bg_color": "#F8EBDA",
        "body": "<p>Seoul Glow Lab works with select Korean beauty brands and U.S. retail partners to help thoughtfully chosen products reach the right audience.</p><p>Our relationships are built differently. We discover brands through our work in Korea, learn directly from the people behind the formulas, and bring that knowledge into the U.S. market through retail, education, and strategic partnerships.</p><p>If you're an indie Korean beauty brand looking for the right U.S. partners, or a retailer looking to discover what's next in Korean skincare, we'd like to hear from you.</p>",
